    { "type": "text", "id": "tg2box", "x": 720, "y": 70, "width": 250, "height": 280,
      "text": "Stage 2 · Flash Lite judge\ngoogle/gemini-3.1-flash-lite\n\nnaturalness: 1-5\n  4 or 5 = keep\n  <= 3 = drop\n\nfact_preservation\n  fail if output changes source facts\n\ninstruction_following\n  fail if output misses the task\n\nunsupported_details\n  fail if new names/tools/dates invented\n\nai_tells\n  fail if Certainly / Of course / filler", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1,
